本许可证是一份自由的、非商业的、具有 Copyleft 性质的软件许可证。它授予您使用、学习、共享、修改和重新分发本软件的自由，前提是您不得将其用于商业目的。同时，它禁止对涵盖作品的任何部分申请专利，并确保硬件中立性、分发纯净性和操作自主性。

This license is a free, non-commercial, copyleft license for software and other kinds of works. It grants you the freedom to use, study, share, modify, and redistribute the software, provided that you do not use it for commercial purposes. It also prohibits patenting any part of the covered work, and ensures hardware neutrality, distribution purity, and operational autonomy.

---

序言

本许可证旨在保护用户的自由以及 OPENOS 生态系统的完整性。我们相信，软件绝不应被用来限制用户的硬件选择、推送不需要的广告或将用户锁在系统之外。我们也相信，软件应保持不受商业剥削和任何试图通过专利主张占有其思想的行为——这些行为实际上是从社区中夺取所有权。

因此，本许可证允许任何人将本软件用于个人、教育、非营利或社区目的，但禁止商业使用和针对涵盖作品或其衍生作品进行专利注册。

Preamble

This License is designed to protect both the freedom of users and the integrity of the OPENOS ecosystem. We believe that software should never be used to restrict users' hardware choices, to push unwanted advertisements, or to lock users out of their own systems. We also believe that software should remain free from commercial exploitation and from any attempt to patent the ideas it implements, which would effectively claim ownership over something that belongs to the community.

Therefore, this License allows anyone to use, share, modify, and distribute the software for personal, educational, non-profit, or community purposes, but prohibits commercial use and patent registration of the covered work or its derivatives.

